.ft P
.fi
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
Generate the abbreviations for the \fBfish\-lsp\fP language server binary:
.RS 2
.sp
.nf
.ft C
>_ fish\-lsp complete \-\-abbreviations | source
.ft P
.fi
.RE

